# Cache & temp
# Anchored to repo root — an unanchored `cache/` matched at any depth and
# silently untracked two real Go packages named `cache` (free/byok/go/cache/,
# free/nself-eval-gate/internal/cache/) when they arrived in the P6
# free-by-default migration. Root is still covered for actual build-cache
# output; source directories legitimately named `cache/` are no longer hit.
/.cache/
/cache/
*.tmp
*.temp
tmp/

